# Human review for the files that decide whether a change is judged fairly.
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS, replace @OWNER with a person or team, and turn
# on "Require review from Code Owners" for the default branch; without that
# setting this file only suggests reviewers.
#
# Tests and their locks: an agent may add tests through test-first, but a
# person approves what they assert.
changes/**/lock.md      @OWNER
